{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32380","headline":"春初对暮雨 · 温庭筠","name":"春初对暮雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淅沥生丛筱，空蒙泫网轩。\n暝姿看远树，春意入尘根。\n点细飘风急，声轻入夜繁。\n雀喧争槿树，人静出蔬园。\n瓦湿光先起，房深影易昏。\n不应江上草，相与滞王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}